WEBVTT

00:00:28.941 --> 00:00:33.404
But melatonin isn't quite
as effective as you may think.

00:00:34.030 --> 00:00:36.407
[Sleeping with Science]

00:00:38.493 --> 00:00:40.745
For example, if you pull together

00:00:40.787 --> 00:00:44.999
all of the recent scientific studies
on sleep and melatonin,

00:00:44.999 --> 00:00:48.336
which is a technique
that we call a meta-analysis,

00:00:48.377 --> 00:00:49.504
we've discovered

00:00:49.545 --> 00:00:53.591
that melatonin only increases
the speed with which you fall asleep

00:00:53.633 --> 00:00:55.676
by 3.9 minutes

00:00:55.718 --> 00:00:59.305
and only increases
the quality of your sleep,

00:00:59.347 --> 00:01:01.682
what we call your sleep efficiency,